  <VQE_AbandonedARC.questContentRules.rulesStrings>
    <!--EN: allObjectsStudiedMessage->All objects are studied. You've collected the information and can now leave.-->
    <li>allObjectsStudiedMessage-&gt;所有对象均已研究。您已经收集了信息，现在可以离开了。</li>
    <!--EN: halfOfObjectsDestroyedMessage->More than half of the research data has been lost.-->
