  <VQE_AbandonedARC.questDescriptionRules.rulesStrings>
    <!--EN: questDescription->According to the data extracted on the old prototype site, we managed to find the location of an [adj] industrial complex where construction of the [arcName] continued. This sprawling facility was once bustling with engineers and scientists pushing the boundaries of technology, but now it stands in silence, overtaken by the passage of time.\n\nThe site contains [siteDetails], but it is now [siteThreat].\n\n[studyWarning] [questFailWarning]\n\nSuccessfully completing this expedition [questOutcome].-->
    <li>questDescription-&gt;根据在旧原型站点上提取的数据，我们设法找到了[adj]工业综合体的位置，[arcName]的建设仍在此处继续进行。这个庞大的设施曾经熙熙攘攘，挤满了不断突破技术界限的工程师和科学家，但现在它却寂静无声，随着时间的流逝而消失。

该站点包含 [siteDetails]，但现在是 [siteThreat]。

[studyWarning] [questFailWarning]

成功完成本次探险[questOutcome]。</li>
    <!--EN: questDescription->Data from the prototype site revealed the coordinates of an [adj] industrial yard, where the [arcName] was further developed by [inventor_nameFull] and their team. The facility stretches across a vast expanse, its rusting frames and crumbling walls hinting at its former glory.\n\nWithin the complex are [siteDetails], but [siteThreat] must be dealt with before any meaningful research can be done.\n\n[studyWarning] [questFailWarning]\n\nResolving this task [questOutcome].-->
    <li>questDescription-&gt;来自原型站点的数据揭示了 [adj] 工业场的坐标，[arcName] 在那里由 [inventor_nameFull] 及其团队进一步开发。该设施占地广阔，生锈的框架和摇摇欲坠的墙壁暗示着它昔日的辉煌。

建筑群内有[siteDetails]，但在进行任何有意义的研究之前必须处理[siteThreat]。

[studyWarning] [questFailWarning]

正在解决此任务 [questOutcome]。</li>
    <!--EN: questDescription->Analyzing the prototype’s data, we’ve pinpointed the location of an [adj] construction yard that served as the next step in the [arcName] project. This site, once a beacon of industrial ambition, is now a graveyard of innovation, its machinery left to decay under the open sky.\n\nInside, you’ll find [siteDetails], but it is [siteThreat].\n\n[studyWarning] [questFailWarning]\n\nYour efforts here [questOutcome].-->
    <li>questDescription-&gt;通过分析原型数据，我们确定了 [adj] 施工场地的位置，该施工场地将作为 [arcName] 项目的下一步。这个曾经是工业雄心的灯塔，现在是创新的墓地，其机械在露天下腐烂。

在里面，你会发现[siteDetails]，但它是[siteThreat]。

[studyWarning] [questFailWarning]

您在这里所做的努力[questOutcome]。</li>
    <!--EN: questDescription->The data retrieved from the old prototype has led us to an [adj] industrial complex that was pivotal in advancing the [arcName] project. Once a thriving hub of technological development, the facility now lies in ruin, its halls echoing only with the wind.\n\nAmong the remnants are [siteDetails], though the complex has become [siteThreat].\n\n[studyWarning] [questFailWarning]\n\nCompleting this mission [questOutcome].-->
    <li>questDescription-&gt;从旧原型中检索到的数据引导我们找到了一个 [adj] 工业综合体，它对于推进 [arcName] 项目至关重要。该设施曾经是一个繁荣的技术发展中心，现在已成为废墟，其大厅仅随风回响。

遗迹中有[siteDetails]，但该建筑群已变成[siteThreat]。

[studyWarning] [questFailWarning]

完成此任务[questOutcome]。</li>
