  <VQE_ArcSite.questDescriptionRules.rulesStrings>
    <!--EN: questDescription(asker_factionLeader==True)->[asker_nameFull], [asker_faction_leaderTitle] of [asker_faction_name], has sent us a message. A group of [siteFaction_pawnsPlural] has occupied the location of an abandoned ARC generator site. The camp is under the control of [siteFaction_name].\n\n[asker_nameDef] is requesting that we clear out the area by eliminating all enemies and defenses. Once the site is secured, we will have the opportunity to study the ARC generator and recover valuable ARC components. [asker_label] also says that [sitePart0_description].-->
    <li>questDescription(asker_factionLeader==True)-&gt;[asker_nameFull]，[asker_faction_name] 的 [asker_faction_leaderTitle] 已向我们发送消息。一群[siteFaction_pawnsPlural]占领了一个废弃的ARC发生器场地。该营地由[siteFaction_name]控制。

[asker_nameDef]要求我们消灭所有敌人和防御来清理该区域。一旦场地安全，我们将有机会研究 ARC 发生器并回收有价值的 ARC 组件。 [asker_label] 也说 [sitePart0_description]。</li>
    <!--EN: questDescription(askerIsNull==true)->We have received information that an old ARC generator site has been taken over by [siteFaction_pawnsPlural] from [siteFaction_name]. The bandits have fortified their position and are using the location as a hideout.\n\nSecuring the site will allow us to examine the generator for any remaining research data and salvageable ARC components. Be prepared for resistance, as the site is likely heavily guarded. Additionally, [sitePart0_description].-->
    <li>questDescription(askerIsNull==true)-&gt;我们收到信息称，[siteFaction_pawnsPlural] 从 [siteFaction_name] 接管了一个旧的 ARC 生成器站点。强盗们已经加固了他们的阵地，并利用该地点作为藏身之处。

确保该地点的安全将使我们能够检查发电机中是否有任何剩余的研究数据和可回收的 ARC 组件。做好抵抗的准备，因为该地点可能戒备森严。此外，[sitePart0_description]。</li>
    <!--EN: sitePart0_description->the site is partially overgrown, with many of its original structures crumbling from age-->
    <li>sitePart0_description-&gt;该地点部分杂草丛生，许多原始结构因年久而摇摇欲坠</li>
    <!--EN: sitePart0_description->the bandits have fortified the site with makeshift defenses and traps-->
