  <VQE_InventorShelter.questDescriptionRules.rulesStrings>
    <!--EN: questDescription->[dataDiscovery] revealed the location of a [adj] underground [structureType] where [inventor_nameFull] rests in cryptosleep. The journey will be grueling, as the site is afflicted by a[coldSnapDesc], bringing the region into unnaturally low temperatures. \n\nInside the bunker, a few [turretDefense] still guard the interior, powered by an ancient [arcName]. The ARC cannot be studied but can be deconstructed for [arcComponents]. Your primary task, however, is to reach the casket and release the inventor. Prepare carefully for the extreme cold or risk severe [hypothermiaDanger].-->
    <li>questDescription-&gt;[dataDiscovery]揭示了[adj]地下[structureType]的位置，其中[inventor_nameFull]处于加密睡眠状态。这段旅程将非常艰苦，因为该地点受到[coldSnapDesc]的影响，使该地区陷入不自然的低温。 

在碉堡内，一些[turretDefense]仍然守卫着内部，由古老的[arcName]提供动力。 ARC 无法研究，但可以解构 [arcComponents]。然而，你的首要任务是到达棺材并释放发明者。为极端寒冷或严重风险做好准备 [hypothermiaDanger]。</li>
    <!--EN: questDescription->Recovered data points us to a [adj] bunker buried deep beneath a region suffering from a[coldSnapDesc]. It is here that [inventor_nameFull], the legendary mind behind the ARC project, lies sealed in cryptosleep. \n\nThe area’s temperatures are falling to dangerous lows, creating an immediate risk of [hypothermiaDanger] during your approach. Inside, [turretDefense] remain active, powered by an overgrown [arcName]. The ARC can be deconstructed for [arcComponents], but the real prize is freeing the inventor and bringing them back to your colony.-->
    <li>questDescription-&gt;恢复的数据向我们指出了一个深埋在遭受[coldSnapDesc]影响的区域下方的[adj]掩体。正是在这里，ARC 项目背后的传奇人物 [inventor_nameFull] 被密封在加密睡眠中。 

该地区的气温正降至危险的低点，在您接近时会立即面临 [hypothermiaDanger] 的风险。在内部，[turretDefense] 仍然活跃，由杂草丛生的 [arcName] 提供动力。 ARC 可以被解构 [arcComponents]，但真正的奖励是释放发明者并将他们带回您的殖民地。</li>
    <!--EN: questDescription->We’ve identified the location of a [adj] [structureType] where [inventor_nameFull] has been preserved in a cryptosleep casket. The area surrounding the site is cursed with a[coldSnapDesc], plummeting temperatures to deadly extremes. \n\nThe bunker itself houses a few [turretDefense], powered by an overgrown [arcName]. While the ARC cannot be studied, it can be salvaged for [arcComponents]. Be ready for freezing conditions and hypothermia as you attempt to retrieve the legendary inventor.-->
    <li>questDescription-&gt;我们已经确定了 [adj] [structureType] 的位置，其中 [inventor_nameFull] 已保存在加密睡眠棺材中。该地点周围的区域受到[coldSnapDesc]的诅咒，气温骤降到致命的极端。 

地堡本身容纳了一些[turretDefense]，由杂草丛生的[arcName]提供动力。虽然无法研究 ARC，但可以将其抢救为 [arcComponents]。当你试图找回这位传奇发明家时，请做好应对冰冻和低温的准备。</li>
