    <!--EN: questDescription(asker_factionLeader==True)->[asker_nameFull], [asker_faction_leaderTitle] of [asker_faction_name], has sent us a message. A group of [siteFaction_pawnsPlural] has taken control of an abandoned nuclear ARC husk site. The camp is currently under the control of [siteFaction_name].\n\n[asker_nameDef] is requesting that we clear out the area by eliminating all enemies and defenses. Once the site is secured, we will have the opportunity to study the nuclear ARC husk and recover valuable ARC components. [asker_label] also mentions that [sitePart0_description]. [sitePart1_description]-->
    <li>questDescription(asker_factionLeader==True)-&gt;[asker_nameFull]，[asker_faction_name] 的 [asker_faction_leaderTitle] 已向我们发送消息。一群 [siteFaction_pawnsPlural] 已经控制了一个废弃的 ARC 核外壳站点。该营地目前由[siteFaction_name]控制。

[asker_nameDef]要求我们消灭所有敌人和防御来清理该区域。一旦场地安全，我们将有机会研究 ARC 核外壳并回收有价值的 ARC 组件。 [asker_label] 还提到了 [sitePart0_description]。 [sitePart1_description]</li>
    <!--EN: questDescription(askerIsNull==true)->We have received intelligence that an abandoned nuclear ARC husk site has been overtaken by [siteFaction_pawnsPlural] from [siteFaction_name]. The bandits have fortified their position and are using the location as a hideout.\n\nSecuring the site will allow us to examine the nuclear ARC husk for any remaining research data and salvageable ARC components. Be prepared for resistance, as the bandits have likely set up significant defenses. Additionally, [sitePart0_description]. [sitePart1_description]-->
    <li>questDescription(askerIsNull==true)-&gt;我们收到情报，一个废弃的 ARC 核外壳站点已被来自 [siteFaction_name] 的 [siteFaction_pawnsPlural] 占领。强盗们已经加固了自己的阵地，并利用该地点作为藏身处。

确保该地点的安全将使我们能够检查 ARC 核外壳，以获取任何剩余的研究数据和可回收的 ARC 组件。做好抵抗的准备，因为土匪可能已经建立了重要的防御设施。此外，[sitePart0_description]。 [sitePart1_description]</li>
