    <!--EN: sitePart0_description->the husk appears partially intact, holding the promise of valuable salvage-->
    <li>sitePart0_description-&gt;外壳看起来部分完好，有望进行有价值的打捞</li>
    <!--EN: sitePart0_description->the site is a mix of ancient industrial ruins and ramshackle bandit encampments-->
    <li>sitePart0_description-&gt;该地点是古代工业废墟和摇摇欲坠的强盗营地的混合体</li>
    <!--EN: sitePart0_description->hostile patrols have been spotted guarding the perimeter-->
    <li>sitePart0_description-&gt;被发现有敌对巡逻队守卫周边</li>
    <!--EN: sitePart0_description->the bandits are using the ARC husk to power their crude machinery and weapons-->
    <li>sitePart0_description-&gt;强盗正在使用 ARC 外壳为其简陋的机械和武器提供动力</li>
    <!--EN: sitePart1_description->The entire area is blanketed in toxic fallout, making prolonged exposure dangerous without proper equipment-->
    <li>sitePart1_description-&gt;整个区域都被有毒尘埃覆盖，如果没有适当的设备，长时间暴露在危险之中</li>
    <!--EN: sitePart1_description->A thick layer of toxic fallout lingers over the site, creating an additional hazard for anyone attempting to approach-->
    <li>sitePart1_description-&gt;该地点上空残留着一层厚厚的有毒尘埃，对任何试图接近的人造成了额外的危险</li>
    <!--EN: sitePart1_description->Toxic fallout from the ARC husk’s old reactor has poisoned the area, presenting a significant environmental danger-->
    <li>sitePart1_description-&gt;ARC 外壳旧反应堆产生的有毒尘埃污染了该地区，造成了严重的环境危险</li>
    <!--EN: sitePart1_description->The site is covered in toxic fallout, making survival without protective gear extremely difficult-->
    <li>sitePart1_description-&gt;该地点被有毒尘埃覆盖，在没有防护装备的情况下生存极其困难</li>
    <!--EN: sitePart1_description->Hazardous fallout clouds the area, a grim reminder of the ARC’s unstable nuclear past-->
    <li>sitePart1_description-&gt;危险的尘埃笼罩该地区，残酷地提醒人们 ARC 不稳定的核过去</li>
  </VQE_NuclearArcSite.questDescriptionRules.rulesStrings>
