  <VQE_PrototypeARC.questDescriptionRules.rulesStrings>
    <!--EN: questDescription(asker_factionLeader==True)->[asker_nameDef], [asker_faction_leaderTitle] of [asker_faction_name], has informed us of an ancient construction site where [inventor_nameFull] once worked on a massive prototype generator. The site appears abandoned and isolated, surrounded by the remnants of a long-forgotten project.\n\n[terminalDetails] Visiting this site may provide [potentialRewards]. [journeyDetails] [finalDetails]-->
    <li>[asker_faction_name] 的 questDescription(asker_factionLeader==True)-&gt;[asker_nameDef]、[asker_faction_leaderTitle] 告诉我们一个古老的建筑工地，[inventor_nameFull] 曾经在那里建造大型原型发电机。该站点显得废弃而孤立，周围环绕着一个长期被遗忘的项目的遗迹。

[terminalDetails]访问此站点可能会提供[potentialRewards]。 [journeyDetails] [finalDetails]</li>
    <!--EN: questDescription(askerIsNull==True)->We have discovered an ancient construction site where [inventor_nameFull] was working on a large prototype generator. The site lies in a remote location, surrounded by the ruins of an unfinished project.\n\n[terminalDetails] Exploring the site may yield [potentialRewards]. [journeyDetails] [finalDetails]-->
    <li>questDescription(askerIsNull==True)-&gt;我们发现了一个古老的建筑工地，[inventor_nameFull] 正在那里建造一台大型原型发电机。该地点位于偏远地区，周围环绕着未完成项目的废墟。

[terminalDetails]探索该地点可能会产生[potentialRewards]。 [journeyDetails] [finalDetails]</li>
    <!--EN: terminalDetails->There is a still-operational terminal containing research notes and schematics of [inventor_nameFull]'s work.-->
    <li>terminalDetails-&gt;有一个仍在运行的终端，其中包含[inventor_nameFull]工作的研究笔记和示意图。</li>
    <!--EN: terminalDetails->An active terminal holds critical data logs and experimental insights into generator construction.-->
    <li>terminalDetails-&gt;活动终端保存关键数据日志和发电机构造的实验见解。</li>
    <!--EN: terminalDetails->The site contains a terminal rumored to have design blueprints and energy research breakthroughs.-->
    <li>terminalDetails-&gt;该网站包含一个据传拥有设计蓝图和能源研究突破的终端。</li>
    <!--EN: terminalDetails->Ancient systems still hum faintly, offering a glimpse into [inventor_nameFull]'s ambitious prototype.-->
    <li>terminalDetails-&gt;古老的系统仍然发出微弱的嗡嗡声，让我们可以一睹[inventor_nameFull]雄心勃勃的原型。</li>
    <!--EN: terminalDetails->A damaged terminal may still hold data on the ARC prototype, but its condition is uncertain.-->
    <li>terminalDetails-&gt;损坏的终端可能仍保留 ARC 原型上的数据，但其状况不确定。</li>
    <!--EN: potentialRewards->rare components, advanced research data, and valuable resources-->
    <li>potentialRewards-&gt;稀有组件、先进研究数据和宝贵资源</li>
    <!--EN: potentialRewards->essential materials, generator schematics, and advanced technology insights-->
    <li>potentialRewards-&gt;基本材料、发电机原理图和先进技术见解</li>
    <!--EN: potentialRewards->valuable knowledge, unique building materials, and rare artifacts-->
    <li>potentialRewards-&gt;宝贵的知识、独特的建筑材料和稀有的文物</li>
    <!--EN: potentialRewards->critical research breakthroughs and a bounty of salvageable materials-->
    <li>potentialRewards-&gt;关键研究突破和大量可回收材料</li>
    <!--EN: potentialRewards->rare loot and potentially groundbreaking energy research-->
    <li>potentialRewards-&gt;稀有战利品和潜在突破性的能源研究</li>
    <!--EN: journeyDetails->The location is far away and will require careful preparation for the trip.-->
    <li>journeyDetails-&gt;地点较远，需要仔细做好行程准备。</li>
    <!--EN: journeyDetails->The long distance to the site makes the expedition challenging but potentially rewarding.-->
    <li>journeyDetails-&gt;距现场较远，使得这次探险充满挑战，但可能会有所收获。</li>
    <!--EN: journeyDetails->Traveling to the site will demand significant time and resources.-->
    <li>journeyDetails-&gt;前往该站点需要大量时间和资源。</li>
    <!--EN: journeyDetails->The journey to this remote site may be dangerous but worth the effort.-->
    <li>journeyDetails-&gt;前往这个偏远地点的旅程可能很危险，但值得付出努力。</li>
    <!--EN: journeyDetails->Its remote location suggests few immediate threats, but supplies will be key.-->
    <li>journeyDetails-&gt;其偏远位置表明几乎没有直接威胁，但补给将是关键。</li>
    <!--EN: finalDetails->While no dangers are expected, the journey itself poses risks to unprepared colonists.-->
    <li>finalDetails-&gt;虽然预计不会有危险，但旅程本身会给毫无准备的殖民者带来风险。</li>
    <!--EN: finalDetails->The site seems derelict, but caution is advised—its isolation may hide unexpected challenges.-->
    <li>finalDetails-&gt;该网站似乎被遗弃了，但建议小心谨慎——它的孤立可能隐藏着意想不到的挑战。</li>
    <!--EN: finalDetails->The area appears uninhabited, but its age may make navigation and survival difficult.-->
    <li>finalDetails-&gt;该地区似乎无人居住，但其年代久远可能导致导航和生存变得困难。</li>
    <!--EN: finalDetails->Prepare for the worst while hoping for the best—opportunity often comes with risk.-->
    <li>finalDetails-&gt;做好最坏的打算，同时抱最好的希望——机会往往伴随着风险。</li>
    <!--EN: finalDetails->The isolation may provide safety, but also leaves little room for error if trouble arises.-->
    <li>finalDetails-&gt;隔离可以提供安全性，但如果出现问题，也几乎没有出错的余地。</li>
  </VQE_PrototypeARC.questDescriptionRules.rulesStrings>
